%% title: `atm doctor`
%% summary: Health and diagnostic flow.
%% commentary: This diagnostic flow should report config, runtime, and optional store-health failures clearly without mutating mailbox state.
%% sets: cli
flowchart TD
    A[atm doctor request] --> B[Daemon doctor handler]
    B --> C1[Read config and team state]
    C1 -->|config error| E1[ConfigFailed]
    C1 --> C2[Read daemon runtime health and singleton state]
    C2 -->|runtime error| E2[DaemonUnavailable or RuntimeDegraded]
    C2 --> C3["Optional SQL health snapshot
store open
schema and lock checks"]
    C3 -->|store error| E3[MailboxReadFailed]
    C3 --> O1[Return doctor report]
